sequenceDiagram
    %% one sync run: scan first, then apply in slabs
    participant watcher as File watcher
    participant sync as Sync engine
    participant fs as Disk
    participant store as Index store
    participant embed as Embedder
    watcher->>sync: paths changed
    sync->>fs: read the changed files
    fs-->>sync: contents
    sync->>sync: classify new, modified, moved, deleted
    loop each slab
        sync->>store: write the rows
        sync->>embed: embed the new chunks
        embed-->>sync: vectors
        sync->>store: write the vectors
    end
    sync-->>watcher: done
